# Line endings a container can run.
#
# A shell script checked out with CRLF (Git for Windows, core.autocrlf=true)
# fails at its first `set -eu` with `illegal option -`, and a Pulumi program
# that reads one with `readFileSync` and ships it into a ConfigMap hands the
# container exactly those bytes: `pg-rename-legacy-names` crash-looped for
# sixteen minutes and blocked a whole `pulumi up` that way on 2026-11-03.
# Pinning the working copy to LF is what makes the checkout match CI's.
*.sh text eol=lf
